# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-09-23 stale-content sweep: keep binaries, corpora and generated
# artifacts out of Git. Manifests, reports (.md/.json) and code stay tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Delivery packages / archives (design references are kept locally only)
*.zip
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

# Third-party clones and downloaded installers (local only)
third_party/
work/tools/

# Training corpora binaries (manifests and GT text stay tracked)
work/training-corpus/**/images/
work/training-corpus/**/pdfs/
work/training-corpus/**/synthetic-scans/

# Generated reports, coverage and logs
.coverage
outputs/pytest-cov.json
outputs/pip-audit.json
outputs/**/*.log
outputs/case-studies/*.pdf

# Local cleanup quarantine from the 2026-09-23 sweep
_cleanup-archive-*/

# Restore-drill copies of real uploads must never enter Git (real customer data)
work/restore-drill-*/uploads/

# 任何本地 data root 都可能收到真实客户材料：BIDPROOF_DATA_ROOT 指到 work/ 下时，
# uploads/ 与 SQLite 文件必须留在本地（历史事故见 AGENTS.md）。
work/*/uploads/
work/*/*.sqlite3*

# 2026-09-24 物料包原件与解包目录（zip 已在上面按 *.zip 忽略）
_incoming-*/

# 本机验证日志（命令输出、回环验证码、一次性驱动脚本）
outputs/verify-logs/

